{"id":"661401","name":"可乐鸡翅","author":"妖妖60","authorId":"6597978","desc":"","cover":"images/661401/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡中翅","amount":"5个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱段","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"在鸡翅两面划刀，以便入味。","img":"images/661401/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把鸡翅放入冷水中焯水，倒入料酒去腥。","img":"images/661401/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮开后捞去浮沫。","img":"images/661401/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把鸡翅捞出。","img":"images/661401/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内倒入油并撒盐，以防粘锅。","img":"images/661401/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小火慢煎至鸡翅两面金黄。","img":"images/661401/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入葱白，生抽，老抽，冰糖。","img":"images/661401/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入可乐淹没鸡翅。","img":"images/661401/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上锅盖小火慢熬。","img":"images/661401/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火收汁并撒上白芝麻。","img":"images/661401/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后撒上葱花，出锅。","img":"images/661401/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"可乐尽量用百事的，偏甜。可口可乐有点苦。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}